# ==============================================================================
# Image Toolbox — Environment Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# The website uses the temporary Cloudflare Workers deployment URL by default.
# When you choose your final brand name and custom domain, set these variables:

# PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://your-final-domain.com
# PUBLIC_SITE_NAME=Your Brand Name

# Changing PUBLIC_SITE_URL automatically updates:
#  - Canonical URLs
#  - Sitemap.xml entries
#  - Hreflang alternate links (all 10 languages + x-default)
#  - OpenGraph URLs
#  - Structured Data (JSON-LD WebApplication, BreadcrumbList, FAQPage)
#  - Robots.txt Sitemap directive
